```16:16:C:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\zhongjiban-ultimate-master\serial-test-z3q2\test-serial-z3q2.js
const CONCURRENCY = 8;
```

以及调用处：

```16:21:C:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\zhongjiban-ultimate-master\serial-test-z3q2\test-serial-z3q2.js
await Promise.all(
  Array.from({ length: CONCURRENCY }, async () => {
    while (true) {
